####Source: Curated - Lexical & Syntax Analysis

::Curated_CD_003::[plain]For the grammar S -> aB, B -> b, the set FOLLOW(B) is {~\{a, b\} =\{$\} ~\{b\} ~\{a\}}
####Source: Curated - Lexical & Syntax Analysis

