####Source: Curated - Memory Management

::Curated_OS_048::[plain]For the page reference string [1, 2, 3, 4, 1, 2, 5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5] and 3 frames, the number of page faults using the optimal replacement policy is ________. {#7}
####Source: Curated - Memory Management

::Curated_OS_049::[plain]For the page reference string [1, 2, 3, 4, 1, 2, 5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5] and 4 frames, the number of page faults using the optimal replacement policy is ________. {#6}
####Source: Curated - Memory Management

